Word-search blocked lists (assets/wordsearch/blocked/<lang>.txt)

Adapted by Verdetto from the sources below, with Verdetto's own additions:
merged per language; non-letters (spaces, hyphens, punctuation, digits)
removed; letters upper-cased; accents dropped for pt, id and ms, and the
Greek tonos dropped; Arabic-script vowel marks and tatweel, and Hebrew
points, removed; Russian Ё written Е; hiragana written as katakana and
small kana full-size; split into the game's cells; entries with any cell
outside the language's script dropped; entries under 3 cells dropped
(2 for zh and ko); duplicates removed; ROT13 applied to ASCII letters.
Decoding is permitted; decoder: any ROT13 tool (Python's codecs "rot13")
or the app's word-search reader.

